## Interface: 16001
## Version: @project-version@
## Title: AKForeverTargeter
## Notes: Targets of interest: a small panel with one row per mob your tracked quests are after (and the NPC to bring a finished quest back to) - click to target it and put a raid marker on it - plus a 3 x 3 marker menu at the mouse. No mob database: kill objectives name their mob, the rest is learned from the game's own tooltips and quest dialogs.
